Output demo/recordings/setup.gif
Set Shell bash
Set FontFamily "JetBrainsMono Nerd Font Mono"
Set FontSize 14
Set Width 1100
Set Height 720
Set TypingSpeed 60ms
Set Theme "Ayu Mirage"

Hide
Type "export XDG_CONFIG_HOME=$(mktemp -d) WAXON_NO_BROWSER=1; clear"
Enter
Show

Type "./waxon"
Enter
Sleep 3s
# Option 1: your own app
Enter
Sleep 4s
Type "bbce036082e24e78ad3905c86ce5946b"
Sleep 600ms
Enter
Sleep 3s
Ctrl+C
Sleep 800ms
